WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.760
Report writing is finally fixed.

2
00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:08.020
Inspection apps keep you at your desk for hours, until Quickler came along.

3
00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:10.040
I'm going to show you how we fixed it.

4
00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:12.980
It's very simple and it will only take a few minutes.

5
00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:15.400
Quickler is all about the in-person visit.

6
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:18.680
You walk around, you send photos and send voice notes.

7
00:00:18.680 --> 00:00:22.340
And Quickler handles the processing of all the information.

8
00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:23.500
Setting up is quick.

9
00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:27.560
Add a check here, say what you'd like checked and press continue.

10
00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:32.900
Or upload a file you already use, and we'll extract the questions.

11
00:00:32.900 --> 00:00:37.800
You can also schedule it and Quickler will chase anyone who forgets.

12
00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:40.680
Here is a site safety inspection on WhatsApp.

13
00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:43.260
We'll say what we're checking and get talking.

14
00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:54.540
You can send voice notes and photos in any order.

15
00:00:54.540 --> 00:00:56.300
Just like you would to a colleague.

16
00:00:56.300 --> 00:01:00.960
After each message, Quickler shows what's still to cover so you

17
00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:02.580
never lose your place.

18
00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:05.220
Anything you don't mention counts as okay.

19
00:01:05.220 --> 00:01:08.120
So you never have to tick 40 boxes later.

20
00:01:08.120 --> 00:01:10.620
And when you're finished, you just say done.

21
00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:14.580
Quickler then sorts all your photos and words into the right places,

22
00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:16.280
ready for you to approve.

23
00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:17.880
This brings us to the record.

24
00:01:17.880 --> 00:01:20.740
If you don't say something, we don't make it up.

25
00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:23.580
If you do, we don't lose it.

26
00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:26.500
Every fault goes into the to-do list at the top.

27
00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:30.200
So issues are flagged to the reader without them having to hunt

28
00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:31.440
through the report.

29
00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:34.940
From there, they can be copied and pasted to wherever they're needed.

30
00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:37.940
Don't like the way something is written?

31
00:01:37.940 --> 00:01:40.340
Click on any answer and type over it.

32
00:01:40.340 --> 00:01:41.920
Has a photo been misrouted?

33
00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:44.000
Drag it to wherever you like.

34
00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.440
Notice something at the end of the visit?

35
00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:48.360
Just say it on WhatsApp.

36
00:01:48.360 --> 00:01:51.480
Sharing the report is very easy using the shareable link.

37
00:01:52.100 --> 00:01:55.980
Do you need it in Word, Excel, or a PDF?

38
00:01:55.980 --> 00:01:57.300
You can do that too.

39
00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:58.500
What about branding?

40
00:01:58.500 --> 00:01:59.520
You can get that as well.

41
00:02:00.460 --> 00:02:01.820
Can you add your whole team?

42
00:02:01.820 --> 00:02:03.560
Yes, just like this.

43
00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:05.940
And it does all of this as well.

44
00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:10.800
Now there's plenty more, but honestly, it's way better to try for yourself.

45
00:02:10.800 --> 00:02:12.640
14 days free at quickler.

46
00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:13.440
co.

47
00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:14.120
No card needed.
